# UI Guidelines (MVP)

Use Tailwind + shadcn/ui.

Mobile first. Bottom navigation on phones. Sidebar on desktop.

Support light/dark mode.

Include loading, empty and error states.

Large touch targets (≥ 48px).

## Native app feel

- Stitch Athletic Precision is mandatory
- Chrome should feel like iOS/Android utilities (clear hierarchy, tonal surfaces, no decorative clutter)
- Prefer bottom sheets for create-tournament and confirm flows
- One-tap poll controls
